---
import Cite from './Cite.astro';
---
<div class="sc">
  <p class="sc__num" aria-hidden="true">100,000<span class="sc__plus">+</span><span class="sc__unit">t</span></p>
  <h2 class="sc__head">
    <span class="visually-hidden">More than 100,000 tonnes. </span>That’s how much plasterboard Australia’s builders send to landfill every year.<Cite id="landfilled" />
  </h2>
  <p class="sc__sub">Offcuts from new construction alone. Board pulled out in renovations and demolition comes on top of that.</p>

  <div class="sc__bars" role="img" aria-label="Bar comparison: over 100,000 tonnes of plasterboard landfilled a year is about 1.9 times the 52,800 tonnes of steel in the Sydney Harbour Bridge.">
    <div class="sc__row">
      <div class="dim sc__dim"><i class="tick tick--l"></i><span>100,000 t a year, plasterboard to landfill</span><i class="tick tick--r"></i></div>
      <div class="sc__bar sc__bar--board"><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span></div>
    </div>
    <div class="sc__row" style="--w: 52.8%">
      <div class="dim sc__dim"><i class="tick tick--l"></i><span>52,800 t, all the steel in the Sydney Harbour Bridge</span><i class="tick tick--r"></i></div>
      <div class="sc__bar sc__bar--steel"></div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <p class="sc__foot">
    Nearly two Harbour Bridges’ worth of steel, in weight, buried every year.<Cite id="harbour-bridge" />
  </p>
</div>

<style>
  .sc__num {
    font: 800 var(--step-5)/0.9 var(--font-display); letter-spacing: -0.05em; color: var(--steel);
    margin: 0 0 0.25em; max-width: none;
  }
  .sc__plus { font-size: 0.6em; vertical-align: 0.42em; margin-left: 0.04em; }
  .sc__unit { font-size: 0.42em; letter-spacing: 0; margin-left: 0.12em; color: var(--navy); }
  .sc__head { font-size: var(--step-2); max-width: 30ch; }
  .sc__sub { color: var(--muted); }
  .sc__bars { margin-top: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 3rem); display: grid; gap: 1.75rem; }
  .sc__row { width: var(--w, 100%); min-width: 15rem; }
  .sc__dim { margin-bottom: 0.5rem; }
  .sc__dim span { white-space: normal; text-align: center; color: var(--ink); font-weight: 600; }
  .sc__bar { height: clamp(84px, 11vw, 132px); border-radius: var(--radius-s); }
  /* the plasterboard bar is drawn as a stack of sheets */
  .sc__bar--board {
    display: grid; grid-template-rows: repeat(6, 1fr); gap: 3px;
  }
  .sc__bar--board span { background: var(--steel); border-radius: 2px; }
  .sc__bar--board span:nth-child(even) { background: #3d76dc; }
  .sc__bar--steel {
    background: repeating-linear-gradient(135deg, var(--navy) 0 10px, #23447f 10px 20px);
  }
  .sc__foot { margin-top: 1.5rem; font-weight: 600; color: var(--navy); }
  @media (max-width: 560px) { .sc__row { width: 100%; } .sc__row[style] .sc__bar { width: 52.8%; } }
</style>
